Available lint rules:

  MPR001 (NamingConvention) - Checks that entities, microflows, pages, and enumerations follow naming conventions
      Category: style, Severity: warning

  MPR002 (EmptyMicroflow) - Checks for microflows, nanoflows and rules that have no activities
      Category: quality, Severity: warning

  MPR003 (DomainModelSize) - Checks that modules have no more than 15 persistent entities
      Category: design, Severity: warning

  MPR004 (EmptyValidationFeedback) - Checks for validation feedback actions with empty message templates (CE0091)
      Category: correctness, Severity: warning

  MPR005 (UnconfiguredImage) - Checks for IMAGE widgets with no source configured (crashes at runtime)
      Category: correctness, Severity: warning

  MPR012 (LegacyImageWidget) - Checks for the legacy static/dynamic image widgets, which the React client does not support (CE0582)
      Category: correctness, Severity: warning

  MPR013 (SnippetCallAppearance) - Checks for snippet calls with Class, Style, DynamicClasses or design properties, which never reach the page (a snippet call renders no element)
      Category: correctness, Severity: warning

  MPR006 (EmptyContainer) - Checks for CONTAINER widgets with no children (valid and renders, but usually a leftover)
      Category: quality, Severity: info

  MPR009 (GallerySelectionListener) - Gallery referenced by DataView's `DataSource: selection X` must set ItemSelectionMode: toggle (Studio Pro CE3637)
      Category: correctness, Severity: error

  MPR010 (DataViewLayoutGrid) - A DataView containing input widgets (a form) should be wrapped in a layout grid so label and input widths render correctly
      Category: design, Severity: warning

  QUAL006 (RequiredCaptionMissingDefaultLanguage) - Checks that every caption mxbuild requires (a tab page caption) has text in the project's default language (CE4899)
      Category: quality, Severity: error

  MPR007 (PageNavigationSecurity) - Checks that pages used in navigation have at least one allowed role (CE0557), and that every user role can open its home page (at Production security, else CE2729 per widget)
      Category: security, Severity: warning

  SEC001 (NoEntityAccessRules) - Checks that persistent entities have at least one access rule
      Category: security, Severity: warning

  SEC002 (WeakPasswordPolicy) - Checks that the password policy requires at least 8 characters
      Category: security, Severity: warning

  SEC003 (DemoUsersActive) - Checks that demo users are disabled when security level is Production
      Category: security, Severity: warning

  SEC010 (PageEntityNotReadable) - Checks that the roles allowed on a page may read the entity each of its data widgets lists (at Production security it renders empty for them, silently)
      Category: security, Severity: warning

  MPR008 (OverlappingActivities) - Microflow activities whose canvas positions overlap, typically caused by missing @position annotations in MDL
      Category: correctness, Severity: warning

  MPR011 (LoopChildContainment) - Microflow activities positioned outside the loop container that holds them, which renders wrong in Studio Pro but passes mx check
      Category: correctness, Severity: warning

  CONV011 (NoCommitInLoop) - Commits should not be inside loops, whether a commit action or a create/change with commit (N+1 performance issue)
      Category: performance, Severity: warning

  CONV012 (ExclusiveSplitCaption) - Exclusive splits should have a meaningful caption describing the decision
      Category: quality, Severity: info

  CONV013 (ErrorHandlingOnCalls) - External service calls (REST, web service, Java action) should have custom error handling
      Category: quality, Severity: warning

  CONV014 (NoContinueErrorHandling) - Activities should not use 'Continue' error handling which silently swallows errors
      Category: quality, Severity: warning

  CONV020 (CreatedObjectNeverPersisted) - A microflow creates an object of a persistent entity without committing it, and never commits, returns, passes on, stores or deletes it
      Category: quality, Severity: warning

  MDL-FLOW01 (IrreducibleFlowGraph) - Microflow branch structure cannot be described faithfully as nested if/then/else
      Category: quality, Severity: info

  MDL-MAP04 (ImportRangeOnObjectMapping) - Import activity stores a First range over an object-rooted mapping (throws at runtime)
      Category: correctness, Severity: error

  CONV020 (ActionUserFeedback) - Page-triggered microflows that commit, import or delete should show the user a message
      Category: quality, Severity: warning

